# Codexeron API

Welcome to the official Codexeron API documentation.

The Codexeron API enables developers to securely integrate applications with the Codexeron platform.

Using the API, you can automate workflows, manage products, process orders, validate licenses, and interact with marketplace resources.

---

# Overview

The Codexeron API is designed to be:

- Fast
- Secure
- RESTful
- Predictable
- Developer-friendly

All API endpoints use HTTPS and exchange data using JSON.

---

# What You Can Do

The Codexeron API allows you to:

- Authenticate applications
- Manage products
- Retrieve marketplace data
- Create and manage orders
- Validate licenses
- Receive webhook events
- Build custom integrations
- Automate business processes

Additional capabilities will be introduced in future releases.

---

# API Features

Core features include:

- REST API
- JSON Responses
- API Key Authentication
- Pagination
- Filtering
- Sorting
- Rate Limiting
- Error Handling
- Webhooks

